sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant KM as KeyManager
    participant KS as Keystore (Ch 20)
    participant DB as SQLCipher Room

    App->>KM: getOrCreateDek()
    KM->>KS: unwrap stored wrapped-DEK with KEK
    KS-->>KM: DEK (in memory, transient)
    KM-->>App: DEK
    App->>DB: open Room with SupportFactory(DEK)
    DB-->>App: queries work, pages encrypted on disk
